and switched it with Leonard's.

10
00:00:44,272 --> 00:00:46,402
You should be ashamed of yourseIf.

11
00:00:46,608 --> 00:00:48,608
(Sheldon:)You're the one who told me
to play with it.

12
00:00:48,818 --> 00:00:52,948
(Spock:)If I told you to jump off the bridge
ofthe Enterprise, would you do it?

13
00:00:53,156 --> 00:00:54,196
(Sheldon:)No.

14
00:00:54,407 --> 00:00:58,457
(Sheldon:)If I got on the bridge of the Enterprise,
l would never ever leave.

